{"id":"2eaad590ac255c04","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-inner-direct-limit-model.md","title":"ZFC Inner Direct Limit Model","display":"df-zfc-inner-direct-limit-model — ZFC Inner Direct Limit Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner-direct-limit-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner-direct-limit-model"],"display":"df-zfc-inner-direct-limit-model — ZFC Inner Direct Limit Model","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-directed-system.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner-direct-limit-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner-direct-limit-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner-direct-limit-model — ZFC Inner Direct Limit Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"08a6ddab7f132c97\" href=\"?note=08a6ddab7f132c97\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-directed-system.md\">../batch13/58-df-directed-system.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3a9f5d3a8e080215\" href=\"?note=3a9f5d3a8e080215\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md\">../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md\">../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,E,\\phi,\\mathcal D,I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,E_\\bullet,j,B_E\\in V\">\\(M,E,\\phi,\\mathcal D,I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,E_\\bullet,j,B_E\\in V\\)</span> (system, stage relations, canonical maps, and limit data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDirectLimitModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDirectLimitModel}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S\\)</span> (order-explicit directed-system predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"08a6ddab7f132c97\" href=\"?note=08a6ddab7f132c97\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-directed-system.md\">../batch13/58-df-directed-system.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S\\)</span> (direct-limit predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3a9f5d3a8e080215\" href=\"?note=3a9f5d3a8e080215\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md\">../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> (two-place well-founded-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9e70b896da231f4f\" href=\"?note=9e70b896da231f4f\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md\">../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}model} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDirectLimitModel}_S(M,E,\\mathcal D,\\phi)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\exists I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,E_\\bullet,j,B_E\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal D=\\langle I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,E_\\bullet,j\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S(M_\\bullet,j,I,\\leq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(E_\\bullet,I,B_E)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(E_\\bullet(i)\\subseteq M_\\bullet(i)\\times M_\\bullet(i)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S(M,\\phi,M_\\bullet,j,I,\\leq)\\land E\\subseteq M\\times M\\land\n\\forall i,h\\in I\\;\\forall a\\in M_\\bullet(i)\\;\\forall b\\in M_\\bullet(h)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle\\phi(i)(a),\\phi(h)(b)\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in I\\;(i\\leq k\\land h\\leq k\\land\n\\langle j(\\langle i,k\\rangle)(a),j(\\langle h,k\\rangle)(b)\\rangle\\in E_\\bullet(k))\\Bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{WF}(E,M)\\Bigr]\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}model} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDirectLimitModel}_S(M,E,\\mathcal D,\\phi)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\exists I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,E_\\bullet,j,B_E\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal D=\\langle I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,E_\\bullet,j\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S(M_\\bullet,j,I,\\leq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(E_\\bullet,I,B_E)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(E_\\bullet(i)\\subseteq M_\\bullet(i)\\times M_\\bullet(i)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S(M,\\phi,M_\\bullet,j,I,\\leq)\\land E\\subseteq M\\times M\\land\n\\forall i,h\\in I\\;\\forall a\\in M_\\bullet(i)\\;\\forall b\\in M_\\bullet(h)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle\\phi(i)(a),\\phi(h)(b)\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in I\\;(i\\leq k\\land h\\leq k\\land\n\\langle j(\\langle i,k\\rangle)(a),j(\\langle h,k\\rangle)(b)\\rangle\\in E_\\bullet(k))\\Bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{WF}(E,M)\\Bigr]\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The direct limit is witnessed by the exact six-argument upstream predicate and the same explicit directing order used by the system predicate. Each stage relation is data in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span>, so the limit relation no longer relies on an undeclared notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in^{M_i}\">\\(\\in^{M_i}\\)</span>; well-foundedness also supplies its carrier, as required upstream.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-directed-system.md","status":"resolved","id":"08a6ddab7f132c97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-directed-system.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md","status":"resolved","id":"3a9f5d3a8e080215","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-directed-system.md","status":"resolved","id":"08a6ddab7f132c97","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S$ (order-explicit directed-system predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-directed-system.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md","status":"resolved","id":"3a9f5d3a8e080215","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S$ (direct-limit predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-direct-limit.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md","status":"resolved","id":"9e70b896da231f4f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}$ (two-place well-founded-relation predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-well-founded.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,E,\\phi,\\mathcal D,I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,E_\\bullet,j,B_E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDirectLimitModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit\\text{-}model} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDirectLimitModel}_S(M,E,\\mathcal D,\\phi)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\exists I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,E_\\bullet,j,B_E\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal D=\\langle I,\\leq,M_\\bullet,E_\\bullet,j\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S(M_\\bullet,j,I,\\leq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(E_\\bullet,I,B_E)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(E_\\bullet(i)\\subseteq M_\\bullet(i)\\times M_\\bullet(i)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S(M,\\phi,M_\\bullet,j,I,\\leq)\\land E\\subseteq M\\times M\\land\n\\forall i,h\\in I\\;\\forall a\\in M_\\bullet(i)\\;\\forall b\\in M_\\bullet(h)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle\\phi(i)(a),\\phi(h)(b)\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in I\\;(i\\leq k\\land h\\leq k\\land\n\\langle j(\\langle i,k\\rangle)(a),j(\\langle h,k\\rangle)(b)\\rangle\\in E_\\bullet(k))\\Bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{WF}(E,M)\\Bigr]\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\in^{M_i}","display":false}],"bytes":2299,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2333","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-inner-direct-limit-model.md|58-df-zfc-inner-direct-limit-model]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","08a6ddab7f132c97","3a9f5d3a8e080215","9e70b896da231f4f","36d7463d215be751"]}